@startuml
left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "Utilisateur" as U

cloud "NASA FIRMS" as FIRMS
cloud "Vertex AI" as VERTEX
cloud "HTTPSMS" as HTTPSMS

node "Serveur JeryMotro\nMachine physique ou VM" as SERVER {

    node "Nginx\nReverse Proxy / TLS" as NGINX {
        artifact "Frontend Web\n(build statique)" as FRONTEND
    }

    node "Services applicatifs" as APPS {
        artifact "Backend FastAPI\nlocalhost:8200" as BACKEND
        artifact "n8n\nlocalhost:5678" as N8N
        artifact "WAHA\nlocalhost:3001" as WAHA
        artifact "SMSGate\nlocalhost:3030\n(si sélectionné)" as SMSGATE
    }

    node "Services de données" as DATA {
        artifact "PostgreSQL" as POSTGRES
        artifact "Qdrant\nlocalhost:6333" as QDRANT
    }
}

U --> SERVER : HTTPS
FIRMS --> SERVER : HTTPS / API FIRMS
SERVER --> VERTEX : HTTPS / API IA
SERVER --> HTTPSMS : HTTPS / API SMS

BACKEND --> POSTGRES : TCP / local
BACKEND --> N8N : HTTP / localhost
BACKEND --> WAHA : HTTP / localhost
BACKEND --> SMSGATE : HTTP / localhost
N8N --> POSTGRES : connexion locale
N8N --> QDRANT : HTTP / localhost
N8N --> VERTEX : HTTPS / API IA
N8N --> WAHA : API locale
N8N --> SMSGATE : API locale

note right of SERVER
Un seul serveur héberge les services
principaux de JeryMotro.
Les communications internes utilisent
localhost et les ports locaux.
end note

note bottom of NGINX
Nginx assure le routage des sous-domaines
vers les services locaux.
end note

note bottom of SMSGATE
Alternative à HTTPSMS.
Le service SMS utilisé dépend de la
configuration définie dans .env.
end note

note bottom of QDRANT
RAG : recherche vectorielle.
end note

note bottom of VERTEX
Chat IA : modèle / génération.
end note

@enduml
